{"id":4853,"date":"2018-06-24T13:39:34","date_gmt":"2018-06-24T17:39:34","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?p=4853"},"modified":"2018-06-24T15:56:34","modified_gmt":"2018-06-24T19:56:34","slug":"workamping-near-the-river-fun","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2018\/06\/24\/workamping-near-the-river-fun\/","title":{"rendered":"Workamping Near The River Fun"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>On this particular Workamping gig, we work Thursday through Wednesday .. 7 days on duty and 7 days off duty.\u00a0 At least one of us needs to be here at the park all 7 days, while the other can run into town for grocery shopping, a visit to the barber or other needs as they arise.<\/p>\n<p>But on the 8th day &#8230; we&#8217;re free to take off and do as we please.\u00a0 And this has been a wonderful benefit of Workamping.\u00a0 We work about 3 hours each of the 7 days we&#8217;re on duty in exchange for our RV site, electricity, wifi, cable TV, heated pool and hot tub.<a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/06\/2017-07-01-12.51.01.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright size-medium wp-image-4859\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/06\/2017-07-01-12.51.01-300x169.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"169\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/06\/2017-07-01-12.51.01-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/06\/2017-07-01-12.51.01-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/06\/2017-07-01-12.51.01-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/06\/2017-07-01-12.51.01.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/a><\/p>\n<p>We have 2 weeks every month to come and go as we please and see the sights &#8230; and since we grew up here in Michigan and lived in Ohio the last 35 years before we hit the road, we&#8217;re fortunate enough to have friends and family visit.<\/p>\n<p>Our first visitors were our daughter Sara and son in law Stu (along with Dulaney and Arlo)<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4856\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4856\" style=\"width: 700px\" class=\"wp-caption alignright\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/06\/2018-06-08-10.22.13.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-4856 size-large\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/06\/2018-06-08-10.22.13-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"394\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/06\/2018-06-08-10.22.13-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/06\/2018-06-08-10.22.13-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/06\/2018-06-08-10.22.13-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/06\/2018-06-08-10.22.13.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px\" \/><\/a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4856\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Herb, Kathy, Dulaney, Sara, Stu, and of course .. Arlo<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>More recently we had a visit from my sister Betsy and brother in law Bob.\u00a0 They live in the Virgin Islands and were up in the Detroit area visiting their sons and were able to take a couple days to come up to <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2017\/09\/23\/rv-park-review-pere-marquette-oaks-rv-condo-resort-michigan\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Pere Marquette RV Resort<\/a> to visit us.<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4861\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4861\" style=\"width: 300px\" class=\"wp-caption alignleft\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/06\/2018-06-22-09.25.34.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-4861 size-medium\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/06\/2018-06-22-09.25.34-300x169.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"169\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/06\/2018-06-22-09.25.34-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/06\/2018-06-22-09.25.34-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/06\/2018-06-22-09.25.34-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/06\/2018-06-22-09.25.34.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4861\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Herb, Kathy, Bob and Betsy<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>My other sister Marilynn lives in Jacksonville and it&#8217;s always great to hook up with family and our visits are too far and few between.<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4862\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4862\" style=\"width: 300px\" class=\"wp-caption alignright\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/06\/Marilynn.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-4862 size-medium\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/06\/Marilynn-300x169.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"169\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/06\/Marilynn-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/06\/Marilynn-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/06\/Marilynn-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/06\/Marilynn.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4862\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Marilynn&#8217;s husband Rick was at work<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>This time we took a rafting trip down the famous <a href=\"http:\/\/www.visitpmriver.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Pere Marquette River<\/a>.\u00a0 The river is 65 miles long and runs from Baldwin to Ludington and on out to Lake Michigan.\u00a0 We traveled only about a half mile as the crow flies, but it took us just about two hours to go from the landing at Green Cottage to Gleason&#8217;s Landing.<\/p>\n<p>The <a href=\"http:\/\/www.visitpmriver.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Pere Marquette River<\/a> is know far and wide for it&#8217;s excellent Trout and Steelhead fishing and since much of the river is in the Manistee National Forest, there&#8217;s a lot of wildlife throughout the area.\u00a0 The video below illustrates our relaxing ride.<\/p>\n<p><iframe loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/08-Lzj8HNZo\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"><\/iframe><\/p>\n<p>So if you ever find an opportunity to visit northern Michigan, make a stop in Baldwin and take a great ride down the Pere Marquette River.\u00a0 <a href=\"http:\/\/www.baldwincanoe.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Baldwin Canoe Rental<\/a> is the ONLY canoe rental on the PERMITTED portion of the river and they know what customer service is.\u00a0 They&#8217;ll spot your car down the river so it&#8217;ll be there ready and waiting for you when you get to your appointed stop.<\/p>\n<p>Tell &#8217;em Herb &amp; Kathy BALDWIN sent you &#8230; see if they&#8217;ll give you a discount (yea right)<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>On this particular Workamping gig, we work Thursday through Wednesday .. 7 days on duty and 7 days off duty.\u00a0 At least one of us needs to be here at the park all 7 days, while the other can run into town for grocery shopping, a visit to the barber or other needs as they &hellip; <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2018\/06\/24\/workamping-near-the-river-fun\/\" class=\"more-link\">Continue reading <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Workamping Near The River Fun<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[406,677,19546,554707329],"tags":[554707354,554707580,554707361,554707578,24218731,554707360,554707459,554707356,11110,554707355,554707579,554707577],"class_list":["post-4853","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-family","category-friends","category-sightseeing","category-traveling","tag-baldwin","tag-baldwin-canoe-rental","tag-canoe","tag-canoeing","tag-family-2","tag-kayak","tag-lake-michigan","tag-ludington","tag-michigan","tag-pere-marquette","tag-rafting","tag-river-rafting"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4853","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=4853"}],"version-history":[{"count":9,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4853\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":4867,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4853\/revisions\/4867"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=4853"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=4853"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=4853"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}